      "side": 1,
      "message": "So SDP record definition shed some light no what\u0027s going on:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/android14-qpr3-release:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/sdp/sdpint.h;l\u003d106?q\u003dfree_pad_ptr\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject:packages%2Fmodules%2FBluetooth%2Fsystem%2Fstack%2Fsdp%2F\n\nSDP record can contain maximum SDP_MAX_REC_ATTR attributes, and their values are stored in attr_pad, which is fixed size SDP_MAX_PAD_LEN (600) but then every falue is limited to SDP_MAX_ATTR_LEN (400)",
      "parentUuid": "dd6f7da6_0efdcc6e",
